2. The following offences may be compounded in accordance with section 73 of the Act by the Authority:
(a)an offence under the Act which is punishable with a fine only;
(b)an offence under section 20, 45, 68(1)(b) or 69 of the Act;
(c)an offence under subsection (1)(a) of section 68 of the Act, where the non-compliance referred to in that subsection constitutes a compoundable offence under paragraph (a) or (b); and
(d)an offence under regulation 11(8), 12(7), 13(3) or 14(5) of the Deposit Insurance and Policy Owners’ Protection Schemes (Deposit Insurance) Regulations 2011 (G.N. No. S 239/2011).
